# FreshCart feature tickets

Create feature tickets for this repo in the Linear **FreshCart** project:

https://linear.app/fe-demo/project/freshcart-536c4def58f4/overview

- Team: Fe-demo (`FE`)
- Project: FreshCart (`P-FE-1`)
- Label: `Feature`
- State: Backlog, unless the user names a different status

Bug reports for this app stay on the same project with the `Bug` label. Do not file FreshCart feature work in another Linear project or in Jira unless the user names a different tracker.

Write the ticket against the current app: FastAPI in `backend/`, React in `frontend/src/`, shopper state in `localStorage` (`freshcart-*` keys). Include acceptance criteria and a short verification flow.
